        <name>
            <text>4.2.5.4 Passende Wellengraphen [Wave graphs matching]</text>
        </name>
        <questiontext format="html">
            <text><![CDATA[
<p class="HELM_exercise">
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        Exercise
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="de">
        Übung
    </span>
    <br/>
</p>
<p>
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        For each of the functions, identify its graph.
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="no">
        Identifiser grafen til hver av funksjonene.
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="de">
        Identifizieren Sie für jede der Funktionen ihren Graphen.
    </span>
</p>
<p>
</p>
<p>
    \(A: y = \displaystyle{@pr_funcs[1]@}\)
</p>
<p>
    \(B: y = \displaystyle{@pr_funcs[2]@} \)
    <br/>
</p>
<p>
    \(C: y = \displaystyle{@pr_funcs[3]@} \)
    <br/>
</p>
<p>
    \(D: y = \displaystyle{@pr_funcs[4]@} \)
</p>
<br/>
<p>
</p>
